• I found two packaging gaps: speech models are downloaded later, and the Cloudflare service does not look for the binary already
  bundled by the installer.

  I’ll bundle a lightweight streaming speech model plus neural VAD, make the app use bundled assets, and add a pre-session screen for
  permissions and capture tests. The code viewer also needs a bounded scroll area and explicit mouse/keyboard interaction.

